# BeatSync 🎵

**BeatSync** is a Node.js + Socket.IO web application that allows multiple users to play the same music simultaneously across different devices, similar to “party mode”. Guests can create or join a music session, and the host can upload tracks in real-time.

---

## Features

- Guest login (enter a name before joining)
- Create or join a music session
- Host can upload MP3 tracks
- Real-time music sync with Socket.IO
- Shows list of connected users
- Simple, mobile-first interface

